sequenceDiagram
    participant USR as Content Consumer
    participant FAPI as FastAPI
    participant RQ as Redis Queue
    participant WKR as Worker Agent
    participant GRAPH as LangGraph Workflow
    participant RAG as Qdrant VectorDB
    participant LLM as OpenAI

    USR ->> FAPI: Request for agent product
    FAPI -->> USR: Job ID
    FAPI ->> RQ: Enqueue job
    RQ ->> WKR: Dispatch job
    WKR ->> GRAPH: Invoke workflow
    GRAPH ->> LLM: Classify / draft
    GRAPH ->> RAG: Vector similarity search
    RAG -->> GRAPH: Retrieved context
    GRAPH ->> LLM: Draft / retry if needed
    GRAPH -->> WKR: Final StoryPlan
    WKR ->> FAPI: Output
    FAPI ->> USR: Output